<p>Thank you for your thorough input!</p>
<p>Your point about the Serpent's Hand is totally right, I'll see about changing that accordingly.</p>
<p>On the book spontainously appearing: I intended to suggest that Motzer was able to send the book to the Foundation's dimension via the use of Ways or the like. Perhaps I need to expound upon that more?</p>
<p>The idea behind the concept is that it contains words from an ancient, somehow malevolent language that induces a sort of &quot;corruption&quot; effect whenever it is used. I can see now that perhaps in its current state, its not as strong an idea as I may have hoped.</p>
<p>On the amnestic usage: My thought process was that the Foundation didn't want personnel (especially D-Class) memorizing any of the words and using them for trouble. The easiest way I saw to ensure that was amnestic treatment. Its also why the words in the test log are partially censored.</p>
<p>I hope I've been successful in answering your questions!</p>

							</div>

								
					
