</ul>
<ul>
<li>Edited the test logs to standardize the use of the terms Subject and derivatives thereof.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>The &quot;enemy&quot; test has been modified to sound a bit better.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>The &quot;improve&quot; test has been slightly modified to make the results more clear.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>Added an extra detail to the Recovery Log to help explain how the Foundation noticed SCP-3348's appearance.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
